WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.349
- Dumped a bunch of crap in a blender

00:00:01.349 --> 00:00:02.182
- Yeah.

00:00:02.182 --> 00:00:03.015
- And blend it.

00:00:03.015 --> 00:00:05.665
- Wait, it's blended too?

00:00:05.665 --> 00:00:08.189
(bass beat music)

00:00:08.189 --> 00:00:10.250
- I have never had a
Frappuccino, not once.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.409
- I have never had a Frappuccino,

00:00:12.409 --> 00:00:15.002
which I know a lot of
people think is weird,

00:00:15.002 --> 00:00:16.554
but I don't drink coffee.

00:00:16.554 --> 00:00:18.244
- I never had any type of coffee

00:00:18.244 --> 00:00:20.624
except for black coffee in my entire life.

00:00:20.624 --> 00:00:22.538
- I have never had a Frappuccino

00:00:22.538 --> 00:00:24.942
nor have I ever had any
coffee flavored anything

00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:28.367
or I guess coffee itself,
it's never appealed to me.

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:29.589
- I always see them doing the pumps.

00:00:29.589 --> 00:00:30.752
When I go in there, I'm just like,

00:00:30.752 --> 00:00:33.138
hi, can I just get like
a small black coffee?

00:00:33.138 --> 00:00:35.320
- I'm trying something
for the first time that

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:39.511
everyone else has had so,
yeah I'm a little nervous.

00:00:39.511 --> 00:00:41.237
- I don't even know
what's in a Frappuccino.

00:00:41.237 --> 00:00:42.781
- Actually, I just looked up on Wikipedia

00:00:42.781 --> 00:00:45.182
(laughing) the ingredients
of Frappuccinos.

00:00:45.182 --> 00:00:49.123
- I assume it's just a
milkshake with coffee in it.

00:00:49.123 --> 00:00:50.768
- Does it make you poop
like regular coffee does?

00:00:50.768 --> 00:00:51.759
(laughing)

00:00:51.759 --> 00:00:52.592
- It makes you poop?

00:00:52.592 --> 00:00:53.425
- Yeah, coffee does,

00:00:53.425 --> 00:00:55.891
I just (blowing) just
a flood gates open up.

00:00:55.891 --> 00:00:58.077
- Why have I not experienced something ...

00:00:58.077 --> 00:00:58.910
- Really?

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:01.505
- That it seems like all of
American has experienced.

00:01:01.505 --> 00:01:04.529
- I'm kind of proud never
having one, I'm just like ...

00:01:04.529 --> 00:01:06.027
- Well now we're gonna ruin it.

00:01:06.027 --> 00:01:07.822
- Here it comes,

00:01:07.822 --> 00:01:09.238
Oh are they different flavors?

00:01:09.238 --> 00:01:11.047
I've never even had
like, cold coffee before.

00:01:11.047 --> 00:01:11.891
- What?

00:01:11.891 --> 00:01:12.878
- Lady and the Tramp style.

00:01:12.878 --> 00:01:13.711
- Yeah.

00:01:13.711 --> 00:01:15.227
- You go left, I go right.

00:01:15.227 --> 00:01:16.560
- Let's do this.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:19.053
(gasp)

00:01:19.053 --> 00:01:21.386
- It's got a strong coffee
aftertaste that I'm not in to

00:01:21.386 --> 00:01:23.406
but like the initial taste

00:01:23.406 --> 00:01:26.500
was kind of like a chocolaty treat.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.793
- It's pretty sweet, I
feel like, the first ...

00:01:28.793 --> 00:01:29.780
It's like a Pepsi.

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:31.379
- That initial sip, you're
just like ya know what

00:01:31.379 --> 00:01:33.002
this is not bad and then

00:01:33.002 --> 00:01:34.331
it just kinda coats your tongue and

00:01:34.331 --> 00:01:36.189
your like alright, I
kinda want to stop now.

00:01:36.189 --> 00:01:37.611
- It's still sitting with me right now.

00:01:37.611 --> 00:01:38.870
- You can't really taste the coffee

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:40.483
which I'm disappointed about.

00:01:40.483 --> 00:01:42.162
I feel like this is a good thing for kids

00:01:42.162 --> 00:01:44.623
to get into coffee with.

00:01:44.623 --> 00:01:45.848
- Oh my God.

00:01:45.848 --> 00:01:46.985
It's green.

00:01:46.985 --> 00:01:48.203
- It looks like it would be healthy

00:01:48.203 --> 00:01:49.185
because it's green.

00:01:49.185 --> 00:01:50.904
- I honestly didn't know

00:01:50.904 --> 00:01:53.010
that you could get a
Frappuccino without coffee.

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:55.803
So, right now my mind's blown.

00:01:55.803 --> 00:01:56.730
- That was a big sip.

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:57.921
- It tastes like a green tea Kit Kat.

00:01:57.921 --> 00:01:59.211
- It's not bad, I don't know,

00:01:59.211 --> 00:02:00.674
it kinda tastes a little minty.

00:02:00.674 --> 00:02:02.441
- That's very like tea.

00:02:02.441 --> 00:02:04.656
- Tasting pretty good, should I get,

00:02:04.656 --> 00:02:05.489
(laughing)

00:02:05.489 --> 00:02:06.322
I guess I'll do another one.

00:02:06.322 --> 00:02:07.753
- It's delicious, it's
like a green tea milkshake.

00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:08.897
- Can I finish this though?

00:02:08.897 --> 00:02:10.946
- This one looks dangerous.

00:02:10.946 --> 00:02:13.752
- I feel like now this is
a drink off the kids menu.

00:02:13.752 --> 00:02:16.307
- Look at that form, perfect.

00:02:16.307 --> 00:02:18.673
- This feels like straight sugar to me,

00:02:18.673 --> 00:02:19.898
but I love it.

00:02:19.898 --> 00:02:21.490
- Actually, this is not that bad.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:22.323
- You like it?

00:02:22.323 --> 00:02:23.156
- I really do.

00:02:23.156 --> 00:02:26.047
- Cherry, strawberry flavor
that's very like, thick.

00:02:26.047 --> 00:02:28.611
- Then that cream just
like, hits you like a train.

00:02:28.611 --> 00:02:29.841
- It's like strawberry milk

00:02:29.841 --> 00:02:31.655
with a bunch of sugar in it I guess

00:02:31.655 --> 00:02:33.882
and I always liked
strawberry milk as a kid.

00:02:33.882 --> 00:02:37.406
- It tastes like a those
old Nestle Quik milkshakes.

00:02:37.406 --> 00:02:39.164
- The strawberry Nestle Quik milkshake.

00:02:39.164 --> 00:02:39.997
- Yes.

00:02:39.997 --> 00:02:42.644
- I could probably down this
in three sips if I wanted to.

00:02:42.644 --> 00:02:44.198
- After going my whole life without

00:02:44.198 --> 00:02:48.414
ever having a Frappuccino
and then now having one

00:02:48.414 --> 00:02:50.463
yeah, the mystery is gone.

00:02:50.463 --> 00:02:51.696
The veil has been lifted.

00:02:51.696 --> 00:02:52.529
- Right.

00:02:52.529 --> 00:02:53.574
- I've seen the wizard.

00:02:53.574 --> 00:02:55.188
- I had no idea Frappuccinos were cold.

00:02:55.188 --> 00:02:56.750
- But maybe in the future,

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:59.222
I'd have a sip of one of
my friend's Frappuccinos.

00:02:59.222 --> 00:03:00.823
- I'm going to stick with black coffee.

00:03:00.823 --> 00:03:02.926
I feel, I feel Frapp'ed out.

00:03:02.926 --> 00:03:04.140
- If I was like, having a bad day

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:05.846
I would order it and just be like fuck it,

00:03:05.846 --> 00:03:06.901
I need this.

00:03:06.901 --> 00:03:07.734
- Wow.

00:03:07.734 --> 00:03:08.567
(laughing)

00:03:08.567 --> 00:03:09.902
- I deserve this.

00:03:09.902 --> 00:03:11.527
- I'm going to be able to
join the Frappuccino cult

00:03:11.527 --> 00:03:16.140
and like, blend in and I
don't have to drink coffee.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:17.244
Great

00:03:17.244 --> 00:03:18.077
Thank you.

00:03:20.197 --> 00:03:22.502
(door opening)

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:24.772
Chelsea, look what I got.

00:03:24.772 --> 00:03:27.522
(soothing music)

00:03:29.941 --> 00:03:31.623
- This is a huge straw.

